```

**Usage (Third step - MANDATORY):**
```xml
<execute_command><command>pwd &amp;&amp; tree --gitignore &amp;&amp; npx -y envinfo --markdown &amp;&amp; npm run</command></execute_command>
```

**Usage (Later steps - Optional):**
